<title>JAPAN: MOF offers 1.5 trln in 6-month T-bills via auction.</title>
<headline>MOF offers 1.5 trln in 6-month T-bills via auction.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Monday it was offering 1.5 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be April 10 and the maturity date will be October 13, 1997.</p>
</text>
